AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:3078") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0010661> "Severe X-linked intellectual disability, Gustavson type is characterized by X-linked intellectual disability, microcephaly, optical atrophy with impaired vision or blindness, a severe hearing defect, facial dysmorphology, spasticity, epileptic seizures and restricted joint movement. It has been described in seven children from two generations of a Swedish family. All patients died in during early childhood.")
